@startuml UC02 - AI Lead Qualification - Sequence Diagram
title UC02 - AI Lead Qualification - Sequence Diagram

actor "Sales User" as Sales
participant "Next.js" as FE
participant "NestJS API" as API
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "n8n" as N8N
participant "AI / LLM" as AI
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Sales -> FE : 1. Request AI Qualification
FE -> API : 2. POST qualification request
API -> DB : 3. Validate Lead
DB --> API : 4. Lead information
API -> MQ : 5. Publish lead.qualification.requested
MQ -> N8N : 6. Deliver message
N8N -> API : 7. GET /leads/:id
API -> DB : 8. Query Lead
DB --> API : 9. Return Lead
N8N -> AI : 10. Analyze Lead
AI --> N8N : 11. Return structured qualification

alt High confidence
    N8N -> API : 12. POST qualification result
else Low confidence
    N8N -> API : 12. POST review-required result
end

@enduml
